        "title": "Define stable ids and report paths for full-page error screens",
        "summary": "A new module in the `common` package establishes a stable registry of full-page error screens, mapping each `ErrorScreenId` to a human-readable title. The `errorReportPath` helper generates a `/report` query string carrying the screen id and an optional origin, while `ERROR_SCREEN_EVENT` names the telemetry signal emitted when a screen renders. `ERROR_SCREEN_DISCORD_URL` is aliased to the existing community invite link so screens can link users to Discord.",
