        "calls": 1,
        "text": "Freebuff built a central list naming every possible full-screen error message, like a sign-in failure or a maintenance notice. Each entry is assigned a unique code that follows the user from the error screen to a report form, letting the service team see exactly where the problem occurred. These definitions are in place now but are not used by any screens yet, so there is no visible change or action needed for you today.",
