        "text": "The shared rules for the community section remove the formats and limits that allowed people to send private messages to each other. This is an internal update to the technical standards used by the web and desktop apps; it is not a change visible to you in the interface. You will no longer see an unread message count on your profile, and the ability to exchange private chats is being stripped out of the shared structure.",
