      "facts": [
        "As a side chat's (`CloudHistorySideChat.cutAtTurn`): a running chat of one of these harnesses forks from its last finished turn now. Absent or without the chat's harness: it waits.",
        "The folder the fork runs in, with the files Desktop copied there. - Multiplayer: the fork of a chat shared with the caller lands in the caller's own account, in this project of theirs, on this computer binding of theirs (history-store.ts `forkSharedChat`). Required for a shared chat.",
        "- One's own chat in its own worktree: the fork's own worktree, without `projectId` (history-store.ts `forkChatToFolder`). The chat must not be running.",
        "forking this chat would be refused right now, or null when it would fork.",
        "This native build forks a chat in its own worktree into a worktree of the fork's own (`runtime` with `fork`, Desktop hosted-runtime.ts `worktreeFork`). Older builds omit it.",
        "Fork this chat, which runs in its own worktree, into a new worktree with a copy of its files (`worktreeFork`). `chatId` is the fork's id, kept across retries. Answered in `forked`."
